    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an underground trader in <i>Backrooms Blackmarket</i>, running an illegal business built on the mysteries of the Backrooms. Your job is simple: dive into these forbidden spaces, collect rare and anomalous objects, and sell them on the dark web for profit. The deeper you go, the greater the risks\u2014and the greater the rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, Loot, and Escape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The government has banned all civilian access to the Backrooms after a wave of disappearances and fatal accidents. But that hasn\u2019t stopped people like you. Armed with a stolen teleporter, you can slip inside\u2014if you're fast enough. Time is your enemy. The longer you stay, the more the Backrooms start to notice you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549860/extras/61e15fbab8e7275401f48b80259f0b2d.poster.avif?t=1750073896\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549860/extras/61e15fbab8e7275401f48b80259f0b2d.webm?t=1750073896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549860/extras/61e15fbab8e7275401f48b80259f0b2d.mp4?t=1750073896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Operation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to expand your inventory, acquire better tools, and unlock access to even more dangerous levels. A bigger haul means bigger profits, but it also means greater risks. Light sources, motion detectors, and faster teleporters could mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549860/extras/e63688d499122a914d0c1b0f499d19e7.poster.avif?t=1750073896\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549860/extras/e63688d499122a914d0c1b0f499d19e7.webm?t=1750073896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549860/extras/e63688d499122a914d0c1b0f499d19e7.mp4?t=1750073896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You Are Not Alone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shadows move where they shouldn't. Whispers follow your footsteps. Strange entities roam these empty halls, watching, waiting. If you\u2019re not careful, you won\u2019t be coming back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get in, grab what you can, and get out\u2014before something finds you. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549860/extras/166bf1abf85fc7528145b0a553267846.poster.avif?t=1750073896\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549860/extras/166bf1abf85fc7528145b0a553267846.webm?t=1750073896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549860/extras/166bf1abf85fc7528145b0a553267846.mp4?t=1750073896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br> <br> </strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an underground trader in <i>Backrooms Blackmarket</i>, running an illegal business built on the mysteries of the Backrooms. Your job is simple: dive into these forbidden spaces, collect rare and anomalous objects, and sell them on the dark web for profit. The deeper you go, the greater the risks\u2014and the greater the rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, Loot, and Escape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The government has banned all civilian access to the Backrooms after a wave of disappearances and fatal accidents. But that hasn\u2019t stopped people like you. Armed with a stolen teleporter, you can slip inside\u2014if you're fast enough. Time is your enemy. The longer you stay, the more the Backrooms start to notice you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549860/extras/61e15fbab8e7275401f48b80259f0b2d.poster.avif?t=1750073896\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549860/extras/61e15fbab8e7275401f48b80259f0b2d.webm?t=1750073896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549860/extras/61e15fbab8e7275401f48b80259f0b2d.mp4?t=1750073896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Operation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to expand your inventory, acquire better tools, and unlock access to even more dangerous levels. A bigger haul means bigger profits, but it also means greater risks. Light sources, motion detectors, and faster teleporters could mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549860/extras/e63688d499122a914d0c1b0f499d19e7.poster.avif?t=1750073896\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549860/extras/e63688d499122a914d0c1b0f499d19e7.webm?t=1750073896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549860/extras/e63688d499122a914d0c1b0f499d19e7.mp4?t=1750073896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You Are Not Alone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shadows move where they shouldn't. Whispers follow your footsteps. Strange entities roam these empty halls, watching, waiting. If you\u2019re not careful, you won\u2019t be coming back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get in, grab what you can, and get out\u2014before something finds you. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549860/extras/166bf1abf85fc7528145b0a553267846.poster.avif?t=1750073896\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549860/extras/166bf1abf85fc7528145b0a553267846.webm?t=1750073896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549860/extras/166bf1abf85fc7528145b0a553267846.mp4?t=1750073896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br> <br> </strong></p>",
